@startuml
' Yang Shuo with OpenAI Codex assistance. #641; original UI authors retained.
' Review corrections: Vincent Lin with OpenAI Codex assistance, 2026-11-02.
' Trace: MainWindow.setWindowDefaultSize/fillInnerParts/executeStudentViewingCommand;
' WindowPlacement.fit; PersonRecordCard copy handling.
!include feature-sequence-style.iuml
participant "window :\nMainWindow" as W
participant "<<class>>\nWindowPlacement" as P

W -> P : fit(saved settings,\nwork areas, primary area)
P --> W : fitted bounds
W -> W : Apply bounds and minimums
create participant "peoplePanel :\nPersonRecordListPanel" as V
W -> V : new PersonRecordListPanel(\nlogic's people list, ...)
participant "logic :\nLogic" as L
W -> W : Assemble split panes\nand CommandBox
note over W
  Command entry stays below both columns.
  Bind result lists once; headings/feedback can scroll.
end note
note over W, L
  Student viewing shortcut
end note
W -> V : getSelectedPersonId()
V --> W : stable selected ID, if any
W -> L : getPersonRecords()
L --> W : current displayed people
alt selected record is a current Student
  W -> L : execute(lessons INDEX\nor history INDEX)
  opt history active or lesson result kind changed
    L -> W : Registered property listener\nupdates active navigation indicators
  end
  L --> W : result
  W -> V : restoreSelection(stable ID)
  W -> W : Show feedback
else absent or wrong-role selection
  W -> W : Show selection guidance
end
note over W, L
  Shortcuts preserve the command draft and focus.
  Card Copy buttons copy exact contact text while
  preserving draft, focus and person selection.
end note
@enduml
